{"metadata":{"title":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)MLNMapViewDelegate(im)mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/maplibre\/maplibre-native\/blob\/main\/platform\/ios\/src\/MLNMapViewDelegate.h#L963","fileName":"MLNMapViewDelegate.h"},"role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"- ("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)UIView","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UIView"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)MLNMapView","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MLNMapView","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"mapView"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:Qoobjc(pl)MLNAnnotation","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"id<MLNAnnotation>"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"annotation"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The map view presenting the annotation callout.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"mapView"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The object representing the annotation with the callout.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"annotation"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The accessory view to display."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The right callout view is typically used to convey information about the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"annotation or to link to custom information provided by your application."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If the view you specify is a descendant of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"UIControl","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" class, you can use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the map view’s delegate to receive notifications when your control is tapped,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by implementing the ","type":"text"},{"code":"-mapView:annotation:calloutAccessoryControlTapped:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"method. If the view you specify does not descend from ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIControl"},{"type":"text","text":", your view is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"responsible for handling any touch events within its bounds.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If this method is absent from the delegate, or if it returns ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"standard callout view has no accessory view on its right side. The return value","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"of this method is ignored if "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:calloutViewForAnnotation:"},{"text":" is present in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the delegate.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To display a view on the callout’s left side, implement the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"-mapView:leftCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Related-examples","type":"heading","level":4,"text":"Related examples"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"TODO: Default callout usage, learn how to modify the view that is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"displayed on the right side of the standard callout bubble.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"abstract":[{"text":"Returns the view to display on the right side of the standard callout bubble.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:rightcalloutaccessoryviewforannotation:"]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapViewDelegate/mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:":{"title":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNMapViewDelegate\/mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnmapviewdelegate\/mapview:rightcalloutaccessoryviewforannotation:","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns the view to display on the right side of the standard callout bubble."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"- "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"mapView:rightCalloutAccessoryViewForAnnotation:"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNMapView":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"MLNMapView","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":